      "writtenOn": "2026-01-14T17:12:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve updated SkSLMetalCodeGenerator to add a cast for `findLSB` and to subtract `clz` from 31 in its `findMSB` emulation. I updated `SkSLWGSLCodeGenerator` to add casts to signed types when calling `findTrailingBit` and `findLeadingBit` on unsigned inputs.\n\nI also updated `findLSB.sksl` and `findMSB.sksl` to assign their values to signed int variables to expose this (it correctly detected tint compilation failure before I updated the wgsl code gen).",
